---
title: contentworker reference architecture
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: contentworker reference architecture, one customer deployment
    accDescr: Three kinds of client reach one customer deployment. Admin users sign in at the web Worker ①, which forwards their requests to the api Worker over the API service binding with a signed x-cw-principal header ②. API and MCP agents call the api directly with bearer tokens ③. The api commits each write to the D1 primary as one unit of work that includes an outbox row ④, then relays the outbox onto the contentworker-events queue in waitUntil ⑤. The engine Worker, which has no public route, consumes those events and runs webhooks, search and vector indexing and live fan-out ⑥, and enqueues purge tags that the delivery and media Workers drain against their own caches ⑦. Public delivery consumers call the delivery gateway with CDA or CPA keys; it authenticates every request from a KV-cached principal ⑧ and forwards a canonical URL keyed by visibility profile to the cached Delivery entrypoint, which reads a D1 read replica only on a miss ⑨. The engine alone writes the media gate in KV ⑩. The media gateway checks each published file URL's token and forwards it to the cached Media entrypoint, which reads the gate, the bytes from R2 and resized variants from Images ⑪. Uploads land in R2 through the api's signed PUT; R2's object-create notification feeds the asset-events queue, and the engine starts one AssetIngestWorkflow per file version, which calls Workers AI through AI Gateway and writes embeddings to Vectorize ⑫. The api and delivery Workers reach the engine's Durable Objects and Workflows through script_name bindings ⑬.

    Admin([Admin users in a browser]):::external
    Agents([API and MCP agents]):::external
    Consumers([Public delivery consumers]):::external

    subgraph Deployment["One customer deployment, deployments/&lt;id&gt;.jsonc"]
        direction LR

        subgraph Routed["Publicly routed: verifies every credential"]
            Web[web Worker: admin UI and gateway]:::primary
            Api[api Worker: Management, Preview, MCP]:::primary
            DGw[delivery gateway, uncached]:::primary
            MGw[media gateway, uncached]:::primary
        end

        subgraph Internal["No public route: trusts only its own caller"]
            DEnt[Delivery entrypoint, Workers Caching]:::primary
            MEnt[Media entrypoint, Workers Caching]:::primary
            Engine[engine Worker: queue consumers and cron]:::primary
            DO[(Durable Objects: LiveHub, SearchShard, CostGuard)]:::store
            WF[Workflows: Agent, Editorial, AssetIngest]:::primary
        end

        D1P[(D1 primary)]:::focal
        D1R[(D1 read replicas)]:::store
        KV[(KV_CACHE: principals, media gate)]:::store
        R2[(R2 MEDIA_BUCKET)]:::store
        EvQ[(contentworker-events queue)]:::focal
        AssetQ[(contentworker-asset-events queue)]:::store
        PurgeQ[(purge and media-purge queues)]:::store
        Vec[(Vectorize index)]:::store
    end

    AI([Workers AI through AI Gateway]):::external
    Media([Images and Stream]):::external

    Admin -->|"① signs in at &lt;domain&gt;"| Web
    Web -->|"② forwards, signed x-cw-principal"| Api
    Web -.->|forwards bearer delivery calls| DGw
    Web -->|reads auth tables| D1P
    Agents -->|"③ call REST and MCP with bearer tokens"| Api

    Api ==>|"④ commits unit with outbox row"| D1P
    Api ==>|"⑤ relays outbox in waitUntil"| EvQ
    EvQ ==>|"⑥ delivers event batches"| Engine
    Engine -->|reads and writes| D1P
    Engine -->|"⑦ enqueues purge tags"| PurgeQ
    PurgeQ -->|drains, rationed| DGw
    PurgeQ -->|drains, rationed| MGw

    Consumers -->|"⑧ read with CDA or CPA keys"| DGw
    DGw -->|looks up cached principal| KV
    DGw -->|"⑨ forwards canonical URL per profile"| DEnt
    D1P -.->|replicates to| D1R
    DEnt -->|reads on cache miss| D1R

    Engine -->|"⑩ writes and removes media gate"| KV
    Consumers -->|"⑪ fetch published files"| MGw
    MGw -->|forwards canonical media URL| MEnt
    MEnt -->|reads gate on miss| KV
    MEnt -->|reads bytes| R2
    MEnt -->|resizes variants| Media

    Api -->|"⑫ stores uploads via signed PUT"| R2
    R2 -.->|notifies object-create| AssetQ
    AssetQ -->|delivers upload events| Engine
    Engine -->|starts runs| WF
    WF -->|calls models| AI
    WF -->|upserts embeddings| Vec
    Api -->|creates video uploads| Media

    Api -->|"⑬ binds by script_name"| DO
    Api -->|starts runs by script_name| WF
    DGw -->|binds LiveHub, SearchShard| DO

